                    917.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A noun derived from a verb or adjective has a technical name: nominalization. The word illustrates its meaning: when we nominalize nominalize, we create the nominalization nominalization. Here are a few examples:",
